<urn:usf:acceptance:naming-completion> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "A proposal deleting a source removes it and reports it. A proposal that writes a new source and deletes the old one in the same transaction leaves exactly one copy and validates the postimage that results. A deletion whose preimage digest is stale is refused. A deletion of an undeclared or unauthorised path is refused. A deletion that would leave a manifest naming a missing source is refused. The command surface names the foundation \"foundation\"." <urn:usf:graph:naming-completion> .
